{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09102","headline":"寄黄刘二尊师 · 韦应物","name":"寄黄刘二尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庐山两道士，各在一峰居。\n矫掌白云表，曦发阳和初。\n清夜降真侣，焚香满空虚。\n中有无爲乐，自然与世疎。\n道尊不可屈，符守岂暇余。\n高斋遥致敬，愿示一编书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}